{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"length","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"We need count binary strings of length 13 that avoid forbidden substrings \"000\" and \"111\". So no three consecutive same bits. Count sequences of length n with no run of 3 same bits. This is classic recurrence. Let a_n be number of binary strings length n with no 000 or 111. We can use DP with states representing last two bits maybe. Let's compute.\n\nDefine states: last two bits pattern. But easier: recurrence a_n = a_{n-1} + a_{n-2}. Wait that's Fibonacci? Let's derive.\n\nLet f(n) be number of valid strings length n. We can consider last run length. Another approach: Let A_n be number ending with ...0, with last run of 0 length 1; B_n ending with ...00 length 2; C_n ending with ...1 length 1; D_n ending with ...11 length 2. Recurrence:\n\nA_n (ending with single 0) can come from previous ending with 1 (C_{n-1} or D_{n-1}) because adding 0 resets run. So A_n = C_{n-1} + D_{n-1}.\n\nB_n (ending with 00) can come from A_{n-1} only (since previous must end with single 0). So B_n = A_{n-1}.\n\nSimilarly C_n = A_{n-1} + B_{n-1} (ending with single 1 from previous ending with 0). D_n = C_{n-1}.\n\nTotal f(n)=A_n+B_n+C_n+D_n.\n\nBase n=1: strings: \"0\",\"1\". For n=1: A_1=1 (0), B_1=0, C_1=1, D_1=0. f(1)=2.\n\nn=2: compute:\nA_2 = C_1 + D_1 =1+0=1 (string \"10\")\nB_2 = A_1 =1 (string \"00\")\nC_2 = A_1 + B_1 =1+0=1 (string \"01\")\nD_2 = C_1 =1 (string \"11\")\nf(2)=1+1+1+1=4 (all 4 strings allowed, since no 3 same).\n\nn=3: \nA_3 = C_2 + D_2 =1+1=2 (strings ending 0 with run1: \"110\",\"010\")\nB_3 = A_2 =1 (string \"100\")\nC_3 = A_2 + B_2 =1+1=2 (strings ending 1 run1: \"001\",\"101\")\nD_3 = C_2 =1 (string \"011\")\nf(3)=2+1+2+1=6. Indeed total 8 minus 2 forbidden (000,111) =6.\n\nn=4:\nA_4 = C_3 + D_3 =2+1=3\nB_4 = A_3 =2\nC_4 = A_3 + B_3 =2+1=3\nD_4 = C_3 =2\nf(4)=3+2+3+2=10. Check known sequence: number of binary strings length n without 3 consecutive equal bits: sequence A000... Let's compute further.\n\nn=5:\nA5 = C4 + D4 =3+2=5\nB5 = A4 =3\nC5 = A4 + B4 =3+2=5\nD5 = C4 =3\nf"}}],"created":1790941457,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4111,"total_tokens":4879,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-s9cziT2TPQKuBZU1EJMSYjvWaZvgi9y6","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4111,"prompt_ms":509.183,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12385867185599611,"prompt_per_second":8073.718093494873,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2412.249,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.1450443285528027,"predicted_per_second":317.9605422159985}}